WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
If I buy more, we can negotiate the price.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,600
Two hundred yuan a piece

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,800
Old man, do you think I look like a fool?

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,800
This one is exactly the same as the one set up on the street in Dongfang District.

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,800
They only sell them for 70 yuan each

6
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,200
You want me two hundred, where is your conscience?

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,200
You can keep this broken bowl and play with it slowly.

8
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Little brother, that two hundred yuan is the price to outsiders.

9
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,800
But old man, I and you are the same as before

10
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,800
That's it, I'll suffer a loss today

11
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,800
If you can buy more than two pieces, I'll discount it by another ten yuan.

12
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,800
Okay, then go and get me a bag.

13
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:24,940
The one or two I have at home are not enough for a total of twenty.

14
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,740
Calculated at fifty yuan, that’s one thousand yuan

15
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,740
Scan the QR code to pay cash

16
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,940
No, if I buy so much, why don’t you give me a gift?

17
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,940
But old man, this is a small business.

18
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:32,940
That's it

19
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:33,940
It’s also good to put at home as a decoration

20
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:34,940
No problem

21
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,940
Okay, I have a fate with you today

22
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,940
Just make an exception

23
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,940
I'll give this to you as a gift to seal the deal.
